{#
  Tooltip (2.61, theme partial `tooltip`): short help text for a control, shown on hover AND on keyboard focus, linked
  with aria-describedby (the control keeps its own name). It stays while the pointer is over it, Escape hides it
  (WCAG 1.4.13), and it never holds the only copy of key information. Without JavaScript CSS shows it on :hover /
  :focus-within; js/nowo-ui-tooltip.js places it in the viewport (position: fixed, so table scrollers never clip it),
  adds Escape and a tap toggle on touch screens.

      {% embed nowo_ui_partial('tooltip') with {text: 'Exports the filtered rows as CSV'} only %}
          {% block tooltip_trigger %}<a class="nowo-ui-btn nowo-ui-btn--outline nowo-ui-btn--sm" href="…" aria-describedby="{{ tooltip_id }}">Export</a>{% endblock %}
      {% endembed %}

  Required:
    - text (View\Label|string)
  Optional:
    - tooltip_id: the bubble id (default nowo-ui-tooltip-<random>; a partial-scoped name: an inherited `id` is never
      used), also the variable the embed block reads
    - trigger: TRUSTED HTML of the control (printed raw) when not embedding; it must carry aria-describedby="<id>"
    - attr: extra root attributes (no on*)
  Block (embed): tooltip_trigger.
#}
{% set tooltip_id = tooltip_id ?? ('nowo-ui-tooltip-' ~ random()) %}
{% set _attr = nowo_ui_safe_attrs(attr|default({}), ['data-nowo-ui-tooltip']) %}
<span class="nowo-ui-tooltip{{ (_attr.class ?? false) ? ' ' ~ _attr.class }}" data-nowo-ui-tooltip{{ nowo_ui_html_attrs(nowo_ui_attrs_without_class(_attr)) }}>
    {%- block tooltip_trigger %}{{ (trigger ?? '')|raw }}{% endblock -%}
    <span class="nowo-ui-tooltip__bubble" id="{{ tooltip_id }}" role="tooltip">{{ text|nowo_ui_trans }}</span>
</span>
